Wizards shooting

This can be a good oportunity to create a "proyectile system".

Basically something that takes any entity that is a proyectile and update it's transformation every frame.

So a "projectile" in this case should start in an initial position, have a direction and a desired speed.

Every frame the projectile will travel in that direction at that speed.

At some point, the projectile should be destroyed. Maybe after certain time is reached. So maybe also have a life time constant.
